   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reconcile() also reads the Deployment's own status.replicas back; a controller owner reference on both children means deleting the ShippingPolicy garbage-collects both, with no finalizer",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
